            </div>
            <h4 className="font-extrabold text-2xl text-brand-darkGray mb-4 font-display">Reliable Supply</h4>
            <p className="text-brand-darkGray/60 leading-relaxed max-w-xs font-medium">Lagos moves fast, and so do we. Order by 2 PM for same-day delivery right to your kitchen door.</p>
